# Test that [macro name [let params] body] parses correctly.
# This is a parse-only test since macro expansion uses [let ...] patterns.
[macro my-if [let cond then else] [quote [if [unquote cond] [unquote then] [unquote else]]]]
=== warn
unquote of Function(pairs) is not supported
=== out
[macro my-if [let cond then else] [quote [if [unquote cond] [unquote then] [unquote else]]]]
